caption: Channels

Channels are direct conduits of divine power. They have the most flexible Pacts, allowing them to negotiate even the core vow of a pantheon, and to acquire any number of Pacts that their patron agrees to. Channels gain a number of traits that revolve around communing with spirits, and can in fact gain strength from being possessed. They can gain familiars, and can draw power from trapped spirits, called Fetishes.
